水彩纹理，无缝瓷砖，柔和的粉彩\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [330.3492736816406, 154.95484924316406], "pos": [3010.59228515625, -4900.244140625], "id": 80, "properties": {}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["提示词为：叶子"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [-1122.75, -5060.75927734375], "id": 89, "properties": {}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["一.两个工作流都可以生成平图图案\n\n二.工作流功能相当于MJ的无缝平铺功能\n\n三.如要查看无缝平铺图案的效果，点这个免费  https://www.pycheung.com/checker/\n\n四.提示词：\n\n（1）自然主题：\n\n关键词示例：floral patterns（花卉）, leaf motifs（叶子）, animal fur textures（动物皮毛）, ocean waves（海浪波纹）, wood grain（木纹）, marble veins（大理石纹）, clouds（云朵）, forest foliage（森林植被）。\n\n（2）几何与抽象：\n\n关键词示例：geometric shapes（几何形状）, polka dots（波点）, stripes（条纹）, hexagons（六边形）, fractal patterns（分形图案）, low-poly design（低多边形）, abstract gradients（抽象渐变）, 3D cubes（立方体）。\n\n（3）艺术流派：\n\n关键词示例：Art Deco（装饰艺术）, Bauhaus（包豪斯）, Art Nouveau（新艺术）, Surrealism（超现实主义）, Op Art（视错觉艺术）, Japanese Ukiyo-e（浮世绘）, Tribal art（部落艺术）。\n\n（4）文化与民族风：\n\n关键词示例：Aztec patterns（阿兹特克）, African tribal（非洲部落）, Moroccan tiles（摩洛哥瓷砖）, Indian paisley（佩斯利花纹）, Celtic knots（凯尔特结）, Chinese dragons（中国龙纹）, Islamic geometric（伊斯兰几何）。\n\n（5）科技与未来感：\n\n关键词示例：cyberpunk circuits（赛博朋克电路）, neon grid（霓虹网格）, holographic textures（全息质感）, futuristic hexagons（未来感六边形）, glowing lines（发光线条）, digital glitch（数字故障）。\n\n（6）复古与怀旧\n\n关键词示例：retro 80s（80年代复古）, vintage wallpaper（复古壁纸）, Victorian damask（维多利亚提花）, psychedelic swirls（迷幻漩涡）, old newspaper print（旧报纸印刷）。\n\n（7）材料与质感\n\n关键词示例：watercolor splashes（水彩泼溅）, ink blot（墨水渍）, stained glass（彩色玻璃）, metallic foil（金属箔片）, knitted texture（针织纹理）, concrete cracks（混凝土裂纹）。\n\n（8）奇幻与超现实\n\n关键词示例：fantasy dragons（奇幻龙纹）, magic runes（魔法符文）, alien scales（外星鳞片）, celestial constellations（星空星座）, mystic symbols（神秘符号）。\n\n五.进阶组合思路：\n\n（1）.主题 + 风格 + 技术参数\n﻿\n示例：Japanese cherry blossom pattern, watercolor texture, seamless tiling, soft pastel colors \n﻿\n说明：结合主题（樱花）、艺术风格（水彩）。\n﻿\n（2）.混合风格创新\n﻿\n示例：cyberpunk tribal patterns, neon glowing lines, geometric symmetry, dark background \n﻿\n说明：将赛博朋克与部落风格融合，加入发光线条和几何对称。\n﻿\n（3）.材质与光照效果\n﻿\n示例：gold foil Moroccan tiles, intricate embossed details, warm ambient lighting \n\n六.示例提示词是：Japanese cherry blossom pattern, watercolor texture, seamless tiling, soft pastel colors \n\n七.默认图片生成数量20,如需改动，在工作流里的绿色框。\n\n八.有好的提示词，可以交流。\n\n九.效果不好抽卡\n\n十.如需帮助+V:18261580276\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [952.177001953125, 847.093017578125], "pos": [-2195.5361328125, -4854.92822265625], "id": 84, "properties": {}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [55], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "CLIP", "slot_index": 1, "links": [38, 39], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}, {"name": "VAE", "slot_index": 2, "links": [50], "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "size": [380.8381042480469, 98], "pos": [-1196.1090087890625, -5378.298828125], "widgets_values": ["realisticVisionV20_v20.safetensors"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 46, "type": "CheckpointLoaderSimple", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CheckpointLoaderSimple"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["生成数量按自己需求，尺寸1024*1024效果好，建议选择默认。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [218.17471313476562, 241.1668701171875], "pos": [-1091.064453125, -4713.9423828125], "id": 88, "properties": {}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [68], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [273.15679931640625, 262], "pos": [3439.40625, -4963.85498046875], "widgets_values": [207745808519961, "fixed", 28, 8, "dpmpp_2m", "normal", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "